The reference device is the OnePlus 13 (dodge, CPH2653), based on SM8750 and
Qualcomm FastConnect 7900, with the device's existing Snapdragon Sound/R2.2
offload components. Support on other hardware is not established by this
reference. The English patch edition changes identifiers and diagnostic text;
on 2026-10-01, it was built into crDroid 16.0 and validated on the reference
device with hardware DSP offload and dynamic rate switching.

